<div data-kv-root data-klic-material="surface" data-kv-component="watermark" data-kv-variant="toggle-mark" data-klic-component="watermark" class="kn-watermark"><button type="button" data-klic-surface="control" data-kv-action="watermark" aria-pressed="true" data-part="btn">워터마크 표시</button><article data-part="watermarked"><span data-kv-mark aria-hidden="true" data-part="watermark">KLIC PREVIEW</span><header data-part="heading"><strong>리포트 미리 보기</strong></header><div data-part="metric"><span>이번 달 검토</span><strong>128건</strong><p data-part="muted">문서 예제</p></div><p data-part="muted">예제 데이터 · KLIC 미리 보기</p></article></div>
